  "question": {
    "text": "A weak field complex of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> has magnetic moment of 2.82 BM. The number of electron in the <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></msub></math> level of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> will be",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "6",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></math>  <br/>and as <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2.82</mn></math> BM, <br/>So n = 2 <br/>Thus, <math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msubsup><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup></math> configuration is present here. <br/>Hence number of electrons in <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow></msub></math> are 6.",
